exports[`MCP server (in-memory) > lists the expected tools with stable schemas 1`] = `
[
  {
    "description": "Lists every requirement field: plain-language label and question to ask the user, why it matters, whether it is required, allowed values with labels, text length limits, and for choice fields that accept "unsure", the safe default the planner will assume. Call this first so you know what to ask. Ask the user for any missing or unclear requirement; never invent an answer on their behalf. "unsure" is allowed only when the user actually says they are not sure. Plans are reviewable starting points and are NOT production-ready. Say so when presenting one. Never state cost figures or prices; the plans describe cost drivers only. Point users to AWS Pricing Calculator for estimates. Cite only sources returned by these tools (registry ids and URLs). Do not add other links or claims of compliance.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {},
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "get_requirements_schema",
